OL,3,GNEWSAWork on #1.5m nature reserve to
OL,4,Astart next month
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #1.5m project to build a new nature
OL,7,Freserve for a town on poor quality,
OL,8,Funmanaged meadows will start next
OL,9,Fmonth.
OL,11,FThe Kennet Valley Wetland Reserve will
OL,12,Fbe constructed on about 16 hectares (40
OL,13,Facres) of land at Undy's Meadow, on the
OL,14,Fnorthern edge of Hungerford and close
OL,15,Fto the River Kennet.
OL,17,FThe Town and Manor of Hungerford, the
OL,18,Fcharity that organises its Tutti Day
OL,19,Fcelebrations, is behind the plan.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
